  ["Stop everything: the till has no paper and that is a bug. Which built-in raises the crash?"] = "全部止めろ：レジの紙切れはバグです。クラッシュを起こす組み込み関数は？",
  ["Stop when the guest walks out. Fill: case <-ctx.___()"] = "客が帰ったら止める。埋めて：case <-ctx.___()",
