  ["The recursive call must shrink the problem. Fill: return n * fact(___)"] = "再帰呼び出しは問題を小さくする必要があります。穴埋め: return n * fact(___)",
  ["The refund desk"] = "返金カウンター",
  ["The rooftop"] = "屋上",
  ["The root of every request tree. Fill: ctx := context.___()"] = "全リクエストツリーの根。埋めて：ctx := context.___()",
  ["The same keyword as for slices, now on an int. No i := 0; i < 3; i++."] = "slice と同じキーワードを、今度は int に。i := 0; i < 3; i++ は不要。",
  ["The same word as a C-style counted loop."] = "C言語風のカウントループと同じ単語です。",
  ["The same word as the blank import above. Go 1.16."] = "上のブランク import と同じ語。Go 1.16 から。",
  ["The second argument holds the URL, method and body. Fill its type: r *http.___"] = "第2引数は URL、メソッド、ボディを持ちます。型を埋めてください: r *http.___",
  ["The second argument to make is the buffer size."] = "make の第2引数がバッファサイズです。",
  ["The signboard"] = "看板",
  ["The slice built-in that grows. Mark visited when you enqueue, not when you pop."] = "slice を伸ばす組み込み関数。訪問済みにするのはエンキュー時、pop 時ではなく。",
  ["The till"] = "レジ",
  ["The till returns (receipt, err). If err is not the zero value of error, stop. defer close() runs even if you return early."] = "レジは (receipt, err) を返します。err が error のゼロ値でなければ停止。defer close() は早期 return でも実行されます。",
  ["The tray is on the table. One last lesson: a request has a context so the kitchen can stop if the guest walks out. And a test so the next morning still compiles."] = "トレイがテーブルに。最後のレッスン：リクエストには context があり、客が帰れば厨房を止められる。そしてテストがあれば、明日の朝もコンパイルが通ります。",
  ["The tray rail"] = "トレイレール",
  ["The tuple assignment does all three moves at once: Go evaluates the right side first."] = "タプル代入で 3 つの移動を一度に: Go は右辺を先に評価します。",
  ["The type name works as the conversion. Floor and int never mix silently."] = "型名がそのまま変換になります。Floor と int が暗黙に混ざることはありません。",
  ["The type name, inside the parentheses. The second line shows the safe two-value form."] = "括弧の中に型名。2行目は安全な2値の形です。",
  ["The typed-nil trap: return a plain nil error, never a nil *MyError."] = "型付き nil の罠: 素の nil error を返し、nil の *MyError は決して返さない。",
  ["The walk stops when the runner falls off the end. Fill the condition: ___ != nil"] = "走査はランナーが末尾を越えたら止まる。条件を穴埋め: ___ != nil",
  ["The web counter"] = "ウェブカウンター",
  ["The workshop"] = "作業場",
  ["The zero pointer. This is the base case of the tree recursion."] = "ゼロ値のポインタです。木の再帰のベースケース。",
  ["The zero value of a pointer, slice, map, chan, func, or error is ___."] = "pointer、slice、map、chan、func、error のゼロ値は ___ です。",
  ["Three cooks, one ticket rail, one pass. That is a worker pool."] = "料理人 3 人、伝票レール 1 本、受け渡し口 1 つ。それが worker pool。",
  ["Three dots then the element type. Inside the function fares is a []int."] = "3つのドットのあとに要素の型。関数の中では fares は []int です。",
  ["Three letters, capital N. Takes the message, returns an error."] = "3文字、大文字の N。メッセージを受け取り、error を返します。",
  ["Three letters, short for module. The same word as in go.mod."] = "3文字、module の略。go.mod と同じ語です。",
  ["Three letters, short for sequence. Seq2 yields pairs, like index and value."] = "3文字、sequence の略。Seq2 はインデックスと値のようなペアを yield します。",
  ["Three letters. Capacity, not length."] = "3文字。長さではなく容量。",
  ["Three letters. Works anywhere; := only works inside a function."] = "3文字。どこでも使えます。:= は関数の中だけです。",
  ["Three letters. max is its twin. Both take any number of ordered values."] = "3文字。max はその双子。どちらも順序付き値をいくつでも受け取ります。",
  ["Three letters: to examine. ./... means this package and everything under it."] = "3文字: 検査する。./... はこのパッケージと配下すべてです。",
  ["Throw away the bool, keep the error. What character discards?"] = "bool を捨てて error を残す。捨てる文字は？",
  ["Ticket five: the app needs a server. net/http is in the standard library: a handler is a function, a route is a string, the server is one call."] = "チケット5: アプリにはサーバが必要。net/http は標準ライブラリ: handler は関数、ルートは文字列、サーバは呼び出しひとつ。",
  ["Ticket four: orders arrive as JSON. The decoder only sees exported fields, and a tag on the field tells it which key to read."] = "チケット4: 注文は JSON で届きます。デコーダはエクスポートされたフィールドしか見ず、フィールドのタグがどのキーを読むか教えます。",
  ["Ticket seven, the rooftop. The app is live. Newer Go has generic helpers so the old hand-written loops can go: slices, maps, min, and iterators you can range over."] = "チケット7、屋上。アプリは稼働中。新しい Go にはジェネリックなヘルパーがあり、手書きの古いループは不要に: slices、maps、min、そして range できるイテレータ。",
  ["Ticket six: ship it. A module names the project, go.mod pins the dependencies, and the go tool formats, checks and builds. No Makefile needed."] = "チケット6: 出荷。module がプロジェクトを名付け、go.mod が依存を固定し、go ツールが整形・検査・ビルド。Makefile は不要です。",
  ["Ticket three: the menu board takes any. Before the app can print a price it must ask what is inside. Go asks with an assertion or a type switch."] = "チケット3: メニューボードは any を受け取ります。価格を表示する前に中身が何か確かめないと。Go ではアサーションか type switch で問います。",
  ["Ticket two: refunds. An error must say what went wrong, keep its cause, and let the caller ask which kind it was. All of that is in package errors."] = "チケット2: 返金。error は何が起きたかを伝え、原因を保持し、呼び出し側がどの種類か問えるべき。すべて errors パッケージにあります。",
  ["Tilde. Without it, type Cents int would not satisfy Number."] = "チルダ。これがないと type Cents int は Number を満たしません。",
  ["Time the grill. Fill the prefix: func ___Grill(b *testing.B)"] = "グリルの時間を計る。接頭辞を埋めて：func ___Grill(b *testing.B)",
  ["Times Square"] = "タイムズスクエア",
  ["Times Square's LED cube is a slice of frames. An array has a fixed size in the type. A slice does not. append returns a (maybe new) slice."] = "タイムズスクエアのLEDキューブはフレームの slice。配列は型にサイズが固定されている。slice は違う。append は(新しいかもしれない) slice を返す。",
  ["To then Upper. Strings are immutable, so it returns a new one."] = "To のあとに Upper。string は不変なので、新しい string を返します。",
  ["Tram or walk? if the light is green, we go."] = "トラムか徒歩か？ if 青信号なら、行く。",
  ["Turn the Order into JSON bytes. Fill: json.___(order)"] = "Order を JSON のバイト列に。埋めてください: json.___(order)",
  ["Two cooks increment the same tray count. Without a lock that is a race. WaitGroup.Add, Done, Wait is how the pass knows both items are ready."] = "2人のコックが同じトレイ数を増やす。ロックなしでは競合です。WaitGroup.Add、Done、Wait で受け渡し口は両方が揃ったと分かります。",
  ["Two hands, one tray counter. Lock it. Then wait for both cooks."] = "手は2つ、トレイのカウンタは1つ。ロックしろ。そして両方のコックを待て。",
  ["Two letters. == only checks the outer error; this unwraps."] = "2文字。== は外側の error しか見ません。こちらは unwrap します。",
  ["Two letters. Is matches a value; this matches a type and fills the pointer."] = "2文字。Is は値で一致、こちらは型で一致してポインタを埋めます。",
  ["Two letters. Then a function call. The caller does not wait."] = "2文字。その後に関数呼び出し。呼び出し側は待ちません。",
  ["Two packages in one file. What keyword opens the grouped list?"] = "1つのファイルに2つのpackage。まとめたリストを開くキーワードは？",
  ["Two pointers walk inward from both ends. Fill the step: i, j = i+1, ___"] = "2 つのポインタが両端から内側へ。ステップを穴埋め: i, j = i+1, ___",
  ["Two pointers: O(n) time, O(1) extra space. Same trick for sorted-array pair sums."] = "2 ポインタ: 時間 O(n)、追加空間 O(1)。ソート済み配列のペア和にも同じ技。",
  ["Two-sum, palindrome, anagram"] = "Two-sum、回文、アナグラム",
  ["Type parameters go in [T any]. Embedding promotes methods. A closure captures nearby names."] = "型パラメータは [T any] に書く。埋め込みはメソッドを昇格。closure は周囲の名前をキャプチャします。",
  ["Type the answer, then ENTER."] = "答えを入力して ENTER。",
  ["Un + Marshal. It needs a pointer so it can fill your variable."] = "Un + Marshal。変数を埋めるためにポインタが必要です。",
  ["Unexported fields are skipped silently. Capital letters or nothing."] = "非エクスポートのフィールドは黙ってスキップされます。大文字か、さもなくば無し。",
  ["Unmarshal(data, &v). Without & it decodes into a copy and you see nothing."] = "Unmarshal(data, &v)。& がないとコピーにデコードされ、何も見えません。",
  ["Unseen neighbours go to the back of the queue. Fill: queue = ___(queue, nb)"] = "未訪問の隣駅はキューの末尾へ。穴埋め: queue = ___(queue, nb)",
  ["Variables, types, const"] = "変数、型、const",
  ["WHAT ALEX LEARNED: Go basics.   PRIZE: the morning set."] = "アレックスが学んだこと: Goの基本。   ごほうび: モーニングセット。",
  ["WHAT ALEX LEARNED: goroutines, channels, sync.   PRIZE: the morning set."] = "アレックスが学んだこと: goroutine、channel、sync。   ごほうび: モーニングセット。",
  ["WHAT ALEX LEARNED: recursion, trees, graphs, lists, sorting, hashing, workers.   PRIZE: HIRED."] = "アレックスが学んだこと: 再帰、木、グラフ、リスト、ソート、ハッシュ、ワーカー。   ごほうび: 採用。",
  ["WHAT ALEX LEARNED: strings, errors, JSON, HTTP.   PRIZE: the app is live."] = "アレックスが学んだこと: string、error、JSON、HTTP。   ごほうび: アプリ公開。",
  ["WIND"] = "窓",
  ["Wait on muffin or hash brown, whichever is ready. Which keyword?"] = "マフィンかハッシュブラウン、先に準備できた方を待つ。キーワードは？",
  ["Wait then close(results) in a goroutine: the receiver's range ends cleanly. No leaks."] = "goroutine 内で Wait してから close(results): 受信側の range がきれいに終わる。リークなし。",
  ["Wait until both cooks call Done. Fill: var wg sync.___"] = "両方のコックが Done を呼ぶまで待つ。埋めて：var wg sync.___",
  ["WaitGroup.Add(n), Done(), Wait(). The tray leaves when n hits zero."] = "WaitGroup.Add(n)、Done()、Wait()。n がゼロになるとトレイが出ます。",
  ["Walk every shop name in a slice. Fill: for _, name := ___ shops"] = "slice の店名を全部たどる。埋める: for _, name := ___ shops",
  ["Warm the grill exactly once, however many cooks call it. Fill: var once sync.___"] = "何人のコックが呼んでもグリルの予熱は一度だけ。埋めて：var once sync.___",
  ["Was the key there? The second result is a bool named ___."] = "キーはあった？ 2つ目の結果は ___ という名前の bool。",
  ["We already checked mid, so skip past it. hi = mid keeps the half-open rule."] = "mid は確認済みなので飛ばす。hi = mid で半開区間の規則を保ちます。",
  ["Welcome to CODE RUSH! Round one: factorial, then fib without the exponential blowup. Buzzer's live!"] = "CODE RUSH へようこそ！第 1 ラウンド: 階乗、次は指数爆発しない fib。ブザー、オン！",
  ["What is the lightweight thread go starts called?"] = "go が起動する軽量スレッドの名前は？",
  ["Which standard package prints to the terminal?"] = "ターミナルに出力する標準packageはどれですか？",
  ["With, then the word for a time limit. WithDeadline takes a clock time instead."] = "With の後に制限時間を表す単語。WithDeadline は代わりに時刻を取ります。",
  ["WithTimeout returns a child that cancels itself. Always defer cancel() or you leak."] = "WithTimeout は自らキャンセルする子を返します。必ず defer cancel() を、さもないとリークします。",
  ["Worker pool and pipeline"] = "worker pool とパイプライン",
  ["Worker pool: N goroutines range over a jobs channel; close(jobs) ends them; WaitGroup then close(results)."] = "worker pool: N 個の goroutine が jobs channel を range; close(jobs) で終了; WaitGroup の後 close(results)。",
  ["Workers are identical goroutines sharing one input channel. The channel is the queue."] = "worker は 1 つの入力 channel を共有する同一の goroutine。channel がキューです。",
  ["Works on slices, strings, maps, channels. cap is the capacity."] = "slice、string、map、channel に使えます。cap は容量です。",
  ["Write the reply into w, not the terminal. Which fmt function?"] = "返信をターミナルではなく w に書きます。fmt のどの関数？",
  ["[3]string is an array: a value, fixed length, copied on assignment. []string is a slice."] = "[3]string は配列: 値型、固定長、代入でコピー。[]string は slice。",
  ["[T any] is the widest constraint. comparable is for map keys."] = "[T any] が最も広い制約。comparable は map のキー用です。",
  ["[]int is a slice. [3]int is an array of three. Slices are what you use."] = "[]int は slice。[3]int は要素3つの配列。普段使うのは slice です。",
  ["[]rune(s) once, then index freely. Interviewers check this in Go."] = "[]rune(s) を一度、あとは自由にインデックス。Go の面接で必ず見られます。",
  ["_ means I know this exists and I am ignoring it on purpose."] = "_ は「存在は知っているが、わざと無視する」という意味です。",
  ['___ fry("hashbrown")\n___ toast("muffin")\n'] = '___ fry("hashbrown")\n___ toast("muffin")\n',
  ["___ luckymac/delivery\n\ngo 1.22\n\nrequire github.com/lib/pq v1.10.9\n"] = "___ luckymac/delivery\n\ngo 1.22\n\nrequire github.com/lib/pq v1.10.9\n",
  ["___ tap(card string) bool {\n    return true\n}\n"] = "___ tap(card string) bool {\n    return true\n}\n",
  ["___ {\ncase m := <-muffin:\n    serve(m)\ncase h := <-hash:\n    serve(h)\n}\n"] = "___ {\ncase m := <-muffin:\n    serve(m)\ncase h := <-hash:\n    serve(h)\n}\n",
  ["___(ch)\nx, ok := <-ch          // ok is false after\n"] = "___(ch)\nx, ok := <-ch          // その後 ok は false\n",
  ["___(floors)                  // len(floors) == 0 after\n"] = "___(floors)                  // 実行後 len(floors) == 0\n",
  ['___(prices, "closed")\n'] = '___(prices, "closed")\n',
  ['___, err := tap("octopus")\n'] = '___, err := tap("octopus")\n',
  ["a := []int{1, 2, 3}\nb := a[:2]\nb[0] = 9\nfmt.Println(a[0])       // prints ___\n"] = "a := []int{1, 2, 3}\nb := a[:2]\nb[0] = 9\nfmt.Println(a[0])       // ___ を出力\n",
  ["a[mid] is too small: the answer is to the right. Fill: lo = ___ + 1"] = "a[mid] が小さすぎる: 答えは右側。穴埋め: lo = ___ + 1",
  ["arrows walk   ESC map"] = "矢印 移動   ESC 地図",
  ["b shares a's array. After b[0] = 9, what does a[0] print?"] = "b は a の配列を共有。b[0] = 9 のあと、a[0] は何を出力？",
  ['b, err := json.___(order)   // []byte\nfmt.Println(string(b))      // {"dish":"set"}\n'] = 'b, err := json.___(order)   // []byte\nfmt.Println(string(b))      // {"dish":"set"}\n',
  ["break leaves the innermost for, switch or select. A label breaks an outer one."] = "break は一番内側の for、switch、select を抜けます。ラベルで外側も抜けられます。",
  ["cap is the room in the backing array. append doubles it when len reaches cap."] = "cap は内部配列の余裕。len が cap に達すると append が倍にします。",
  ["ch := make(___)        // unbuffered\n"] = "ch := make(___)        // バッファなし\n",
  ["ch := make(chan int)\nch <- 1                // nobody receives\nfmt.Println(<-ch)\n// fatal error: all goroutines are asleep - ___!\n"] = "ch := make(chan int)\nch <- 1                // 誰も受信しない\nfmt.Println(<-ch)\n// fatal error: all goroutines are asleep - ___!\n",
  ['ch := make(chan string)\nch ___ "muffin"        // send\n'] = 'ch := make(chan string)\nch ___ "muffin"        // 送信\n',
  ['ch := make(chan string, ___)   // buffered\nch <- "muffin"                 // does not block yet\n'] = 'ch := make(chan string, ___)   // バッファあり\nch <- "muffin"                 // まだブロックしない\n',
  ["ch <- x sends. x := <-ch receives. Same operator, different place."] = "ch <- x が送信。x := <-ch が受信。同じ演算子、違う位置。",
  ["chan is a typed pipe. <- sends and receives. close tells receivers to stop."] = "chan は型付きパイプ。<- で送受信。close で受信側に終了を伝えます。",
  ["chan struct{} plus close is the cheapest done signal. context.Done() returns one."] = "chan struct{} と close が最も安価な完了シグナル。context.Done() もこれを返します。",
  ["cheapest := ___(muffin, hash, coffee)   // built-in\n"] = "cheapest := ___(muffin, hash, coffee)   // 組み込み\n",
  ["clear(m) deletes every key. Before 1.21 you looped with delete."] = "clear(m) は全キーを削除。1.21 より前は delete でループしていました。",
  ["close(ch). range ch stops when the channel is closed."] = "close(ch)。range ch は channel が閉じると止まります。",
  ["close(jobs) is the shutdown signal: every worker's range loop drains and exits."] = "close(jobs) が終了の合図: 各 worker の range ループが残りを処理して抜けます。",
  ["comparable for map keys and ==. any allows everything but promises nothing."] = "map のキーと == には comparable。any は全てを許すが何も保証しません。",
  ["const (\n    Muffin = ___       // 0\n    Hash               // 1\n    Coffee             // 2\n)\n"] = "const (\n    Muffin = ___       // 0\n    Hash               // 1\n    Coffee             // 2\n)\n",
  ["const opens = 6. The lift knows when breakfast starts."] = "const opens = 6。エレベーターは朝食の時間を知っています。",
  ["context carries deadlines and cancel. go test runs Test* in _test.go."] = "context は期限とキャンセルを運びます。go test は _test.go の Test* を実行します。",
  ["context.Background() then WithCancel. Always defer cancel()."] = "context.Background() の後に WithCancel。必ず defer cancel() を。",
  ["continue skips one round; break ends the loop."] = "continue は1回飛ばし、break はループを終えます。",
  ["ctx := context.___()\nctx, cancel := context.WithCancel(ctx)\ndefer cancel()\n"] = "ctx := context.___()\nctx, cancel := context.WithCancel(ctx)\ndefer cancel()\n",
  ["ctx, cancel := context.___(ctx, 2*time.Second)\ndefer cancel()          // always\n"] = "ctx, cancel := context.___(ctx, 2*time.Second)\ndefer cancel()          // 必ず\n",
  ["ctx.Done() closes on cancel or deadline; ctx.Err() says which one."] = "ctx.Done() はキャンセルか期限で閉じ、ctx.Err() がどちらかを教えます。",
  ["default: runs when every channel would block. The till stays free."] = "default: は全 channel がブロックする時に実行。レジは空いたままです。",
  ["defer captures its arguments now, not later. What does this print?"] = "defer は引数を後ではなく今キャプチャします。何が出力される？",
  ["defer evaluates arguments immediately. defer func() { fmt.Println(x) }() would print 2."] = "defer は引数を即座に評価します。defer func() { fmt.Println(x) }() なら 2 が出ます。",
  ["defer f.Close(). The drawer shuts even if Pay fails."] = "defer f.Close()。Pay が失敗しても引き出しは閉まります。",
  ["defer func() {\n    if r := ___(); r != nil {\n        // saved the till\n    }\n}()\n"] = "defer func() {\n    if r := ___(); r != nil {\n        // レジを救った\n    }\n}()\n",
  ["delete(m, k) removes it. Maps grow by assignment, shrink by this."] = "delete(m, k) で削除。map は代入で増え、これで減ります。",
  ["delete(m, key). Safe if the key is already gone."] = "delete(m, key)。キーがすでに無くても安全です。",
  ["done := make(chan ___)   // zero bytes per value\ngo func() {\n    cook()\n    close(done)\n}()\n<-done\n"] = "done := make(chan ___)   // 1値あたり 0 バイト\ngo func() {\n    cook()\n    close(done)\n}()\n<-done\n",
  ["error is an interface. Check err != nil. defer runs when the function returns."] = "error は interface です。err != nil を確認。defer は関数の return 時に実行されます。",
  ["error is interface{ Error() string }. Your own types can carry data."] = "error は interface{ Error() string }。自作の型にデータを持たせられます。",
  ["errors.As finds the first error of that type and stores it in re."] = "errors.As はその型の最初の error を見つけて re に格納します。",
  ["errors.Is compares values down the chain. Use it instead of ==."] = "errors.Is はチェーンをたどって値を比較します。== の代わりに使いましょう。",
  ["errors.New for fixed messages; name them ErrSomething at package level."] = "固定メッセージには errors.New。パッケージレベルで ErrSomething と名付けます。",
  ["errors.New makes one. %w wraps one. errors.Is and errors.As search the chain."] = "errors.New で作り、%w でラップ。errors.Is と errors.As でチェーンを探します。",
  ['f, err := os.Open("order.txt")\n___ f.Close()\n'] = 'f, err := os.Open("order.txt")\n___ f.Close()\n',
  ["fmt prints a type your way if it has one method. Fill: func (o Order) ___() string"] = "メソッドを1つ持てば fmt は型を好きな形で出力します。埋める: func (o Order) ___() string",
  ['fmt.___(w, "served %s", item)   // w is an io.Writer\n'] = 'fmt.___(w, "served %s", item)   // w は io.Writer\n',
  ["for _, s := range shops {\n    if s.closed {\n        ___                // next shop\n    }\n    fmt.Println(s.name)\n}\n"] = "for _, s := range shops {\n    if s.closed {\n        ___                // 次の店\n    }\n    fmt.Println(s.name)\n}\n",
  ['for _, s := range shops {\n    if s.name == "Lucky Mac" {\n        found = s\n        ___\n    }\n}\n'] = 'for _, s := range shops {\n    if s.name == "Lucky Mac" {\n        found = s\n        ___\n    }\n}\n',
  ["for i := ___ 3 {        // 0, 1, 2\n    fmt.Println(i)\n}\n"] = "for i := ___ 3 {        // 0, 1, 2\n    fmt.Println(i)\n}\n",
  ["for i < 8 is a while. for { } is forever. for i := 0; i < n; i++ counts."] = "for i < 8 は while。for { } は無限ループ。for i := 0; i < n; i++ はカウント。",
  ["for i, j := 0, 0; i < len(l) && j < len(r); {\n    if l[i] <= r[j] {\n        out = append(out, l[i])\n        ___++\n    } else {\n        out = append(out, r[j])\n        j++\n"] = "for i, j := 0, 0; i < len(l) && j < len(r); {\n    if l[i] <= r[j] {\n        out = append(out, l[i])\n        ___++\n    } else {\n        out = append(out, r[j])\n        j++\n",
  ['for i, r := range "銅鑼灣" {\n    fmt.Println(i, ___(r))   // 0 銅, 3 鑼, 6 灣\n}\n'] = 'for i, r := range "銅鑼灣" {\n    fmt.Println(i, ___(r))   // 0 銅, 3 鑼, 6 灣\n}\n',
  ["for i, v := range s. Use _ when you do not need the index."] = "for i, v := range s。インデックスが不要なら _ を使います。",
